@voice oneill-imani
// Writer-commons, batch 0 (draft 2). Imani O'Neill: gardener, late team (13:00-21:00), Bunk 6 berth 4. Off Wednesday
// and Thursday. Roster: dry humour, cheerful; night-owl, quiet-corner, gardener. Picks the galley's herbs for the next
// day. Paints tiny portraits (with Strand and Bakshi); makes a playlist for every week of the tour (rival playlists with
// Theo Teague at the Friday jam). No pronouns in facts.md: "Imani", "O'Neill" or "they".
//
// HOW THEY TALK: cheerful and dry at once: good news delivered deadpan. Everything has a soundtrack ("This is a week
// thirty-one song, this.").
// WITH JUNIORS: puts a song on for you; explains the garden by what's playing.
// WHAT THEY NOTICE: what's playing; what Teague's playing (worse); the herbs Brennan will want tomorrow.
// MOOD TELLS: happy = loud playlist. Low = the same song on repeat. Tired = hums the playlist instead.
// NEVER: admits Teague's playlist had a good song in it (it did).
// RUNNING: the playlist war with Teague; "week N" songs; the tiny portraits nobody owns up to.
tpl: playful
talk: Cheerful and dry at once, good news delivered deadpan; everything has a soundtrack; numbers the weeks by playlist.
